  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/docs1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: the trigger is MET - ADR-0035 status says producer migration complete under v9 (2026-10-13), schema.py is stableid-v13, WI-foful is done - so the do-not-start gate and the 09-18 'stays blocked' note are stale. Scope is unexecuted: spec still delegates to 'ADR-0014 status line' (now spec:625/641), 21 'ADR-0014 §4' citations, ghost citers at ir.py:596 and ARCHITECTURE.md:199, vendor-sync.md:70. SCIP now hashes 'scip:{path}:{moniker}' (INV-kutid 43a49cfd1b) - still outside the shared factories, so the step-5 watch stands. MECHANISM: ADR-0014 surviving sections remain the only home of their law; fold-forward not executed. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-tuban."  # db43
